# Host-based redirects (old domain → open-mercy.com, www → apex, pages.dev
# → apex) live in functions/_middleware.js. They CANNOT live here: Pages'
# _redirects rejects absolute-URL sources ("Only relative URLs are allowed"),
# and silently skips them in the build log.
#
# NOTE: no `/* /index.html 200` rule — Cloudflare Pages flags it as an
# infinite loop and ignores it. Deep links (/leaderboard, /p/<code>) are
# served by Pages' automatic SPA fallback (no 404.html in the build output),
# verified via `wrangler pages dev`.
